<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Goals  The Goals page makes saving money more interactive and motivating. Instead of simply tracking amounts, you set clear financial targets that are displayed with progress bars, showing how much you have saved versus your goal. Each goal has a defined XP reward, meaning that as you save, you are also rewarded within the system. Completing goals unlocks achievements and reinforces consistent financial discipline, turning long-term habits into short-term wins.)
/E (Goals  The Goals page makes saving money more interactive and motivating. Instead of simply tracking amounts, you set clear financial targets that are displayed with progress bars, showing how much you have saved versus your goal. Each goal has a defined XP reward, meaning that as you save, you are also rewarded within the system. Completing goals unlocks achievements and reinforces consistent financial discipline, turning long-term habits into short-term wins.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
