/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Challenges  Challenges transform everyday financial habits into friendly competitions. On this page, you can browse, join, or create challenges, whether individually or with friends and communities. Each challenge has its own objectives, deadlines, and XP rewards. Progress is tracked in real time, and completing challenges not only strengthens your financial discipline but also gives you bragging rights and recognition within your community..)
/E (Challenges  Challenges transform everyday financial habits into friendly competitions. On this page, you can browse, join, or create challenges, whether individually or with friends and communities. Each challenge has its own objectives, deadlines, and XP rewards. Progress is tracked in real time, and completing challenges not only strengthens your financial discipline but also gives you bragging rights and recognition within your community..)
