/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Learning Modules The Learning page turns financial education into a structured, rewarding experience. It contains modules made up of short lessons, each focused on a key financial concept such as budgeting, saving, or investing. At the end of each lesson, you complete a quiz that tests your understanding. Correct answers reward you with XP, meaning that as you improve your knowledge, you also advance within the system. This ensures that learning about money is not only practical but also motivating.)
/E (Learning Modules The Learning page turns financial education into a structured, rewarding experience. It contains modules made up of short lessons, each focused on a key financial concept such as budgeting, saving, or investing. At the end of each lesson, you complete a quiz that tests your understanding. Correct answers reward you with XP, meaning that as you improve your knowledge, you also advance within the system. This ensures that learning about money is not only practical but also motivating.)
