231 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Profile The Profile page is your personal hub. At the top, it displays your avatar, name, and tier level, along with a performance panel summarizing your financial accuracy, leaderboard position, and overall activity. Below, you can view your current goals, complete with progress indicators, and see your most recent achievements. Subsections of the profile allow you to edit your personal details, update security settings such as your password, and manage your friends list or pending requests. The Profile also contains an activity snapshot, showing your most recent actions within the system. In essence, this page provides a complete view of your identity, progress, and preferences, all in one place.)
/E (Profile The Profile page is your personal hub. At the top, it displays your avatar, name, and tier level, along with a performance panel summarizing your financial accuracy, leaderboard position, and overall activity. Below, you can view your current goals, complete with progress indicators, and see your most recent achievements. Subsections of the profile allow you to edit your personal details, update security settings such as your password, and manage your friends list or pending requests. The Profile also contains an activity snapshot, showing your most recent actions within the system. In essence, this page provides a complete view of your identity, progress, and preferences, all in one place.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
